rage** (~$40/month).\n2. **If you’re on a budget:** Stick with **`cpu-optimized-128gb`** and **4-bit quantization**, but expect **high latency** (~30–60 sec per query).\n3. **Check current prices:** DigitalOcean’s pricing page updates monthly—verify [here](https://www.digitalocean.com/pricing) before committing.\n\n**Never use:**\n- **Standard droplets (no NVMe):** They’re **SSD-only**, which kills I/O performance for LLM workloads.\n- **`gpu-240gb` with T4 GPUs:** The **16GB VRAM** is a dealbreaker for 7B models—even quantized, you’ll OOM.",
